irculantes do fármaco</span></p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 1 day</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>15 mg/kg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg/kg = 'mg/kg')</span></td></tr></table><p><b>maxDosePerAdministration</b>: 500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></p></blockquote></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Crianças &lt; 40 kg em hemodiálise</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Regime em diálise peritoneal</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td><td><b>MaxDosePerPeriod</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Máximo de 500 mg/dia de amoxicilina</td><td>500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span>/1 day<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  coded = 'd')</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Doentes em diálise peritoneal</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Ajuste da dose</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*