</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">TFG superior a 30 ml/min</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Não é necessário ajuste</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">TFG 10 a 30 ml/min</span></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>text</b>: 15 mg/kg administrados duas vezes por dia (máximo 500 mg duas vezes por dia)</p><p><b>timing</b>: 2 per 1 day</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>15 mg/kg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg/kg = 'mg/kg')</span></td></tr></table><p><b>maxDosePerAdministration</b>: 500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></p></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">TFG inferior a 10 ml/min</span></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>text</b>: 15 mg/kg administrados como dose única diária (máximo 500 mg)</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 1 day</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>15 mg/kg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg/kg = 'mg/kg')</span></td></tr></table><p><b>maxDosePerAdministration</b>: 500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></p></blockquote></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Crianças &lt; 40 kg com compromisso renal</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuidelin